{"code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7694117511490440216","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/9f61512edee0f43c55de4b42aba461de~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799163024&x-signature=NW8gM4Q2ZF3lTbW1H6w%2Fl1WVX9c%3D","duration":3058,"title":"装穷回家，考验俩儿子的孝心","video_desc":"二十多年前，周振山因车祸失忆，与妻儿失散。多年后，他已成为集团董事长，带着一份“两个儿子各继承一半家产”的遗嘱装穷回家认亲。但这份遗嘱还没有签字——谁真心认这个穷爹、谁真正孝顺母亲，谁才有资格继承；谁把父母当累赘，谁就可能一分钱都拿不到。一个住洋楼却连药费都不肯出，一个穷得揭不开锅却坚持养爹娘。随着一次次考验，原本五五开的继承权悄然改变。真正能继承财富的人，先要守得住亲情、孝心与担当。","series_id":"7694113790018718745","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623302300CA3F294775F299F681\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"aigc,shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7694113790018718745\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.0541987344622612,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.8536763191223145,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":2.0049636363983154,\\\"finish\\\":0.08035746961832047,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.08856788277626038,\\\"like\\\":0.07921033352613449,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.26086559891700745}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7694113790018718745","play_cnt":7693762,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"杭州萧山破格出品文化创意工作室个体工商户","sub_title":"家庭·全48集","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":48,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5468,\"name\":\"家庭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5468&categoryName=家庭&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5509,\"name\